  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SP - Boost Amazon Economy - Commercial Development of Farmlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic partnership with Corpocampo NGO to support the Acai-value chain, through inclusion of 1000 small scale farmers in the Amazon region of Putomayo. The purpose of the project is to boost the income for the farmers and to create alternative crops to the illegal crops traditionally associated with the region.</narrative>
  </description>
